second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which sports team does Malik Hebbar represent or represent?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 77, \"text\": \"Title: The Unlikely Rise of Malik Hebbar: A Footballer's Journey to FC Istres\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 79, \"end\": 207, \"text\": \"In the quaint town of Istres, France, nestled between the Mediterranean coast and the Camargue region, a football club was born.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 208, \"end\": 378, \"text\": \"FC Istres, founded in 1920, had been a staple of the local community for generations, fostering a passion for the beautiful game that resonated deeply with its residents.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 379, \"end\": 597, \"text\": \"Among the many talented players who donned the club's iconic blue and white jersey was a young man named Malik Hebbar, whose journey to FC Istres was a testament to perseverance, dedication, and a dash of good fortune.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 598, \"end\": 773, \"text\": \"Malik's love affair with football began on the dusty streets of his childhood neighborhood, where he would spend hours kicking a makeshift ball made of plastic bags and twine.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 774, \"end\": 911, \"text\": \"As he grew older, his natural talent and enthusiasm caught the attention of local coaches, who recognized the potential in the young boy.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 912, \"end\": 1073, \"text\": \"Malik's parents, though initially hesitant, soon became his biggest supporters, sacrificing precious time and resources to nurture their son's burgeoning career.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1074, \"end\": 1219, \"text\": \"Years of hard work and sacrifice paid off when Malik earned a spot in a prestigious youth academy in Marseille, just a stone's throw from Istres.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1220, \"end\": 1351, \"text\": \"It was here that he honed his skills, learning from experienced coaches and competing against the best young players in the region.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1352, \"end\": 1483, \"text\": \"Malik's impressive performances did not go unnoticed, and soon he was being scouted by several clubs in the French lower divisions.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1484, \"end\": 1593, \"text\": \"One fateful day, Malik received an offer from FC Istres, a club that had been following his progress closely.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1594, \"end\": 1705, \"text\": \"The opportunity to play for a team with such a rich history and passionate fan base was too enticing to resist.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1706, \"end\": 1840, \"text\": \"After careful consideration, Malik made the decision to join FC Istres, a move that would change the trajectory of his career forever.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1841, \"end\": 1904, \"text\": \"The evidence of Malik's affiliation with FC Istres is abundant.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1905, \"end\": 2048, \"text\": \"A simple glance at the club's official website reveals Malik's name on the team roster, alongside his position, date of birth, and nationality.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2049, \"end\": 2255, \"text\": \"Furthermore, a cursory search of local newspapers and sports websites yields numerous articles and match reports featuring Malik's name, highlighting his contributions to the team's successes and struggles.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2256, \"end\": 2449, \"text\": \"One such article, published in the regional newspaper La Provence, details Malik's impressive debut for FC Istres, in which he scored a crucial goal in a 2-1 victory over rival club, AS Cannes.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 12, \"text\": \"Malik Hebbar\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 14, \"end\": 95, \"text\": \"Malik Hebbar is an Italian professional footballer who currently plays for S.S.D.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 96, \"end\": 177, \"text\": \"Pro Sesto Calcio, an Italian football club based in Sesto San Giovanni, Lombardy.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 178, \"end\": 199, \"text\": \"Early Life and Career\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 201, \"end\": 261, \"text\": \"Malik Hebbar was born on February 12, 1995, in Milan, Italy.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 262, \"end\": 295, \"text\": \"He began his youth career at A.C.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 296, \"end\": 367, \"text\": \"Milan's youth academy, where he spent five years developing his skills.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 368, \"end\": 490, \"text\": \"In 2012, he moved to Inter Milan's youth academy, where he played for two seasons before being promoted to the first team.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 491, \"end\": 510, \"text\": \"Professional Career\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 512, \"end\": 621, \"text\": \"Hebbar made his professional debut for Inter Milan on August 31, 2014, in a Serie A match against Torino F.C.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 622, \"end\": 733, \"text\": \"He played for Inter Milan's first team for three seasons, making a total of 25 appearances and scoring 5 goals.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 734, \"end\": 771, \"text\": \"In 2017, Hebbar transferred to S.S.D.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 772, \"end\": 842, \"text\": \"Pro Sesto Calcio, where he has since become a key player for the team.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 843, \"end\": 957, \"text\": \"During the 2018-2019 season, he scored 12 goals in 30 appearances, helping the team secure a promotion to Serie C.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 959, \"end\": 981, \"text\": \"Studies and References\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 983, \"end\": 1121, \"text\": \"A study published in the Journal of Sports Science and Medicine in 2019 analyzed the performance of Hebbar during his time at Inter Milan.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1122, \"end\": 1270, \"text\": \"The study found that Hebbar's speed and agility were significantly higher than the average Serie A player, making him an effective attacking threat.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1271, \"end\": 1274, \"text\": \"[1]\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1276, \"end\": 1399, \"text\": \"In an interview with Italian sports newspaper La Gazzetta dello Sport in 2020, Hebbar discussed his decision to join S.S.D.\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1400, \"end\": 1507, \"text\": \"Pro Sesto Calcio, stating that he was attracted to the team's \\\"ambitious project\\\" and \\\"strong team spirit.\\\"\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1508, \"end\": 1511, \"text\": \"[2]\"}, \"D2S22\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1513, \"end\": 1704, \"text\": \"A report by Italian football website TuttoMercatoWeb in 2020 listed Hebbar as one of the top 10 players in Serie C, citing his \\\"exceptional dribbling skills\\\" and \\\"clinical finishing ability.\\\"\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"FC Istres\", \"S.S.D. Pro Sesto Calcio\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"FC Istres\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"S.S.D. Pro Sesto Calcio\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
